#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/Fine_grained_TP.md:42
msgid ""
"`o_proj` TP is only supported in Graph mode during Decode, because dummy_run"
" in eager mode will not trigger o_proj."
msgstr "`o_proj` TP仅在解码阶段的Graph模式下支持，因为Eager模式下的dummy_run不会触发o_proj。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/Fine_grained_TP.md:43
msgid ""
"`mlp` TP supports dense models, or dense layers in MoE models. For example, "
"the first three dense layers of DeepSeek-R1."
